## What NOT to build (scope guard)

Do not implement unless explicitly asked: mouse forwarding, screen capture/video, voice chat, Steam/Epic integration, macOS/Linux, cloud accounts/login, recording/session replay, anti-cheat bypass. Warn users to avoid online modes instead.

---

## UI philosophy

App lives in system tray. Overlay is a small pill-shaped always-on-top widget showing active player's name; draggable, hideable. Pass-stick action is a system hotkey (RegisterHotKey). Guests see: enter room code → enter name → join → tray icon → toast when they get the stick. Overlay should look understated like Discord's "you're in a voice channel" bar. Use borderless windowed mode for the overlay to appear; true fullscreen exclusive hides the overlay.

---

## Relay server (reference)

Node.js + `ws`. CREATE room, JOIN with roomCode+name, broadcast PLAYER_LIST. PASS_STICK from host → send YOU_HAVE_IT to target guest, broadcast PASS_STICK. KEY_EVENT and PAD_STATE from guest → forward to host only. 30-minute idle timeout per room (setTimeout, reset on any message). fly.toml: use v2 format `[http_service]` with `internal_port = 8080`.

---

## Build order

- **[PHASE 1]** — HookManager, InputInjector, UAC check. Local only, no network. Prove keyboard suppression and injection.
- **[PHASE 2]** — RelayClient, server.js, Constants (PTS_RELAY_URL), keyboard over WebSocket, MapVirtualKey on host, guest disconnect reclaim.
- **[PHASE 3]** — ControllerCapture (delta send only), ViGEm, HidHideManager.
- **[PHASE 4]** — Overlay, tray, RegisterHotKey, single .exe with host/guest mode (first-run wizard, --guest flag), Inno Setup with optional ViGEmBus + HidHide.
- **[PHASE 5]** — Polish, game compatibility test matrix, README (borderless note, PTS_RELAY_URL), MIT license, release.

---

## Reminders

- Always use KEYEVENTF_SCANCODE for keyboard injection; host maps VK to local scan code via MapVirtualKey.
- Always check GetForegroundWindow() PID against pinned game PID before injecting.
- Relay is a message broker only — no interpreting or buffering input.
- Relay stateless for Fly.io free tier; no database, no file I/O.
- Controller: send PAD_STATE only when state differs from previous frame.
- Single installer, two modes (one .exe). Sentence case in UI. Guest client under 5 MB installed.
